    <!-- FAQ Detailed Strings -->
    <string name="label_faq_what_is_zarur_a">Zarur is a modern marketplace app that allows you to buy, sell, and book real estate (houses, apartments, villas), cars, as well as various items and products.</string>
    <string name="label_faq_how_to_post_a">Tap \'Switch to Seller Mode\' in your profile section. In the seller dashboard, click \'Post an Ad\', upload images, and enter title, price, and category information to publish your ad.</string>

    <string name="label_faq_book_how_q">How can I book a property or item?</string>
    <string name="label_faq_book_how_a">Go to your desired item page and tap \'Book Now\'. Select dates and payment method, then confirm payment. After successful booking, an E-Receipt will be generated.</string>

    <string name="label_faq_contact_seller_q">How to contact a seller?</string>
    <string name="label_faq_contact_seller_a">On each ad page, you\'ll find \'Chat\' as well as call (Voice &amp; Video) buttons. You can message the seller directly within the app.</string>

    <string name="label_faq_cart_favorites_q">How do Cart and Favorites work?</string>
    <string name="label_faq_cart_favorites_a">Tap the heart icon on any ad card to save to Favorites, or tap the cart icon to add to Cart. Manage all saved items in the Favorites tab in the bottom menu.</string>

    <string name="label_faq_is_it_safe_a">All user data and payment transactions are secured using Firebase security protocols. You can safely pay using Uzcard, Humo, Visa, and other systems.</string>

    <string name="label_faq_language_theme_q">How to change profile language and app theme?</string>
    <string name="label_faq_language_theme_a">Go to Profile -&gt; \'Language\' to choose Uzbek, Russian, or English. You can also switch dark/light theme in Profile -&gt; \'Dark Mode\'.</string>

